================================================================================
tifffile and macTEM (FormatoTIFF)
================================================================================

Sources/FormatoTIFF/ ports the parts of tifffile 2026.9.20 that RosettaSciIO's tiff
reader relies on: the tag value rules (TiffTag._process_value), the FEI INI parser
(read_fei_metadata, astype, asbool), the ImageJ description parser
(imagej_description_metadata), the ImageJ series rule (series_imagej), the Zeiss
SEM tag parser (read_cz_sem, its unnamed values) and the TVIPS header layout
(read_tvips_header, TVIPS_HEADER_V1 and V2); every
TIFF is compared with tifffile's and RosettaSciIO's reading (tools/tiff-pins/pins.py).
macTEM's TIFF reader (Sources/TEMCore/Data/TIFFImageReader.swift at commit a58c84c,
GPL-3.0) was read as the seed. The planted TIFFs under Tests/FormatoTIFFTests/
Fixtures/planted are written byte by byte by tools/tiff-pins/make_planted.py; the
public TIFFs the pins name are RosettaSciIO's test data (GPL-3.0-or-later), read
from the pinned clone and not committed; the vendor axes (Tests/FormatoTIFFTests/
TIFFVendorAxesTests.swift) are compared on its TVIPS_bin4.zip, tiff_Zeiss_SEM.zip
and JEOL-SightX-*-dummy.tif.gz files.

