================================================================================
HDF5, libaec and libsz (shipped)
================================================================================

tools/xcframework/vendored/ carries HDF5 2.1.1 with libaec 1.1.7 and libsz, arm64, minos 15.0 (otool -l), rebuilt
for 0.2.1 (until 0.2.0 they were mac4DSTEM's Homebrew builds, commit 5ba712a0, minos 26):

    libhdf5.dylib   sha256 d3789c224e6664cd487016a7ef5e71005984f8a04f69a7f643fcdf0332a33491
    libsz.2.dylib   sha256 2621662e6a3550c5d5f0349146baaa8b85964a25d573a0a2d4b571b14ae8a521
    libaec.0.dylib  sha256 e939c1331d1e8b2dfbfb18c1a5e849e6a60fc7aa748bef4c3ddb5d9ab55451c9

The recipe (2026-10-15, Apple clang from Xcode 27, cmake from Homebrew, scratch folder outside the repository, 8 jobs):

    sources  https://github.com/HDFGroup/hdf5/releases/download/2.1.1/hdf5-2.1.1.tar.gz
             sha256 efff93b5a904d66e8f626d7da60b5eedc9faf544be27dbabbaa87967b8ad798b
             https://github.com/MathisRosenhauer/libaec/releases/download/v1.1.7/libaec-1.1.7.tar.gz
             sha256 cc7b93be9002e25a88b45d6b8d5f6120756cb5e1000613f91d803ce0beba24d9
             (both equal GitHub's published asset digests; libaec's also Homebrew's formula)
    env      MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=15.0
    libaec   cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_OSX_ARCHITECTURES=arm64 \
             -DCMAKE_OSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=15.0 -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$P
    hdf5     cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_OSX_ARCHITECTURES=arm64 \
             -DCMAKE_OSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=15.0 -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$P -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=$P \
             -DHDF5_USE_GNU_DIRS=ON -DHDF5_BUILD_FORTRAN=OFF -DHDF5_BUILD_CPP_LIB=OFF -DHDF5_BUILD_EXAMPLES=OFF \
             -DHDF5_BUILD_TOOLS=OFF -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF -DHDF5_ENABLE_SZIP_SUPPORT=ON -DHDF5_ENABLE_ZLIB_SUPPORT=ON \
             -DHDF5_ENABLE_NONSTANDARD_FEATURE_FLOAT16=OFF      (Homebrew's flags, C library only)
    fix-up   install_name_tool on libhdf5: -id @rpath/libhdf5.dylib; libsz and libaec as @loader_path/...; its rpaths
             replaced by @loader_path/../lib; then codesign -s - (ad hoc) on all three, as the earlier copies.
    package  from 0.4.0 tools/xcframework/build.sh repackages the three files, code untouched, as dynamic frameworks
             FormatoLibHDF5, FormatoLibSZ, FormatoLibAEC (install names @rpath/<Name>.framework/Versions/A/<Name>, the three
             load commands between them rewritten to match, ad-hoc signed; Xcode re-signs on embed) in XCFrameworks, released as zips.
    check    otool -l: minos 15.0 in all three; no load command names an absolute path (libz is /usr/lib/libz.1.dylib).
    note     libhdf5's build stamp ("Installation point") names the scratch prefix of the build.

